# Brand and legal

- Display name / tagline / domain / cookie prefix: **only** `apps/edubridge/lib/brand.ts`. Always import; never hardcode or duplicate. Cursor: `.cursor/rules/61-brand-constants.mdc`. Cookie **names** stay on `COOKIE_PREFIX`.
- Legal keywords (entity, court, emails, versions, `LEGAL_DOCS_IN_FORCE`): `apps/edubridge/lib/legal/constants.ts`. Clause prose lives in `features/legal/content/` and interpolates those keywords.
- Never set `LEGAL_DOCS_IN_FORCE` true unless a human named the entity and reviewed the copy.
- Never pre-tick Terms consent. Never drop `termsVersion`. Exclusive forum stays District Court, Jhunjhunu (constants), not concurrent courts.
- Do not claim GDPR, SOC 2, ISO, payment processing, or native apps. New trackers go in `cookie-inventory.ts` before they ship.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — rewriting a liability cap to “sound nicer”
body: "We are not liable for anything."

// ✅ GOOD — bump version and add a section; keep the cap
export const TERMS_VERSION = "2026-09-01";
```
